      ],
      "content": "…; ? Dr Johannes Claesz Furnerius (1582-1668), Rotterdam;{Amsterdam/Paris 2015-16, p. 80.} …; the dealer Georges Ryaux (1894-1978), Paris;{According to Benesch 1954-57, part IV, p. 222, no. C 41.}…; collection of Charles C. Cunningham Jr (b. 1934), Boston, by 1968;{White 1968, p. 392 (as private collection, USA).} from whom, through the mediation of the dealer R.M. Light, Santa Barbara, $356,150, with support of the Vereniging Rembrandt, the Prins Bernardfonds and the Rijksmuseum-Stichting, 1981",
